<title>USA: Sims subsidiary to buy $1 mln in terminals.</title>
<headline>Sims subsidiary to buy $1 mln in terminals.</headline>
<dateline>DELRAY BEACH, Fla. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sims Communications Inc said Friday its wholly owned subsidiary New View Technologies Inc has agreed to buy $1 million worth of terminals from International Verifact Inc.</p>
<p>Sims said International Verifact's C2000 Protege' POS terminals are for prepaid cellular and phone card activation, check verification, ATM debit, and credit card verification.</p>
